<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hamilton Island reports year net loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hamilton Island reports year net loss.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			 loss 2.11 vs profit 4.79</p>
<p>    Net				loss 53.66 vs profit 4.79</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
